I had a pretty good character going on level 17 when I unfortunately put on
a pair of cursed levitation boots.  So I took off my other armor and read a
scroll of destroy armor.  I guess it was cursed though, because it just made
the boots vibrate.  Not having any other means to rid myself of them I
prayed and was rewarded by pissing off Morrigan.

Well, I could have gone off looking for nymphs or succubi, but there was a
polymorph trap nearby, so what hell, maybe I would turn into something that
would force the boots off my feet.  Well, lucky me, I turn into a jaguar,
the boots come off, I slowly float back to the floor, and...

The game drops dead.  The only thing that responds is ctrl-C, and no, I
don't want to quit the game, I want to keep going.  In desperation I manage
to get it to dump core.  It leaves a bunch of *lock* files in the nethack
directory in addition to the core.

So, in addition to wondering if this is a known bug, is there any chance in
hell that I could restore the game with the files that I have?  I am running
nethack 3.09 on an IBM RS/6000.

